
@1=~Ahh, I'm awake! (The creature looks around and then fixes its gaze on you)~
@2=~What have you brought me to eat, stranger? I have trouble holding a conversation on an empty stomach.~ 
@3=~Uhh, what exactly are you eating?~
@4=~I'm looking for a rune. Massena told me I'd find it in a chest on this level.~
@5=~I don't care about your desires, what's in there?~
@6=~That scoundrel speaks the truth. It's very kind of him to send you all the way here.~ 
@7=~What will you give me in exchange for this rune?~ 
@8=~I don't know. What do you want?~ 
@9=~Ha ha ha, an aggressive two-legged creature! We'll calm you down!~
@10=~I see things differently. This conversation has gone on long enough!~ 
@11=~Fresh meat, my friends! Dinner's ready!~ 
@12=~Do I look like I should be eating vegetables? I want fresh meat. Hurry up, I'm hungry!~ 
@13=~That'll be hard to find in a place like this... Anything else?~ 
@14=~Your kind has always lacked common sense, two-legged friend. Look closely, there are some right near me. (She stares at you)~ 
@15=~I see... Sorry, but I'm not on the menu.~
